\subtree{
  \title{Building the forest}
  \p{The forest is built with forester v5 from \code{forest.toml} at the repository root; the theme directory named there is checked out separately (not vendored). Structural checks that do not need forester run in CI: \code{scripts/forest_check.py} (references resolve, decision fields present, no citation of a superseded decision) and \code{scripts/build_registry.py} (the machine-readable registry \code{forest/registry.json} used by the retrieval MCP in \code{mcp/}).}
}
